OL,3,GNEWSA9/11: I want my dad to be
OL,4,Aremembered as the hero he was
OL,5,
OL,6,FEver since he was a young boy and his
OL,7,Ffather relocated to the USA, Godwin
OL,8,FForde had dreamt of living there too.
OL,10,FIn September 2001, he was finally old
OL,11,Fenough to fly out on his own and visit
OL,12,Fhis dad, Godwin Forde senior, and make
OL,13,Fplans to finish school in the States.
OL,15,FHe never got the chance.
OL,17,FHis father was one of 67 British people
OL,18,Fwho died in the deadly al-Qaeda attack
OL,19,Fon the World Trade Centre on September
OL,20,F11, 2001.
